WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Grok Bot receives a request to read Alex’s synthetic chart and draft a follow-up. The connector name was clarified before this request.

00:06.000 --> 00:16.000
Grok drafts an administrative task asking a clinician to review the synthetic HbA1c result. The draft is waiting for human review; no Task has been saved.

00:16.000 --> 00:25.000
Last shows the exact proposal in a separate review inbox. A human reviews and approves it between these screenshots.

00:25.000 --> 00:29.000
Last saves and verifies Task 1053, version 1.

00:29.000 --> 00:39.000
Back in Grok: “Approved. Did it save?” Grok checks the receipt and confirms Task 1053, version 1. A saved follow-up does not mean anyone has contacted Alex.

00:39.000 --> 00:43.000
Edited walkthrough from actual screenshots. Synthetic data only. No patient contact.
